---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Volution"
  description="Volution — affordable air-allergen sensors built by a team of nine."
>
  <p class="back"><a href="/">&larr; Home</a></p>

  <header>
    <h1>Volution</h1>
  </header>

  <p class="lede">Air-allergen sensors. A company of nine. I was CEO.</p>

  <video controls preload="metadata">
    <source src="/media/Volution.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    Your browser does not support embedded video.
  </video>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      2023, penultimate year of school. We built affordable, portable monitors
      that warn asthmatics and allergy sufferers before the air in a room turns
      against them.
    </p>

    <p>
      I am asthmatic. The idea arrived during an attack at 2am, with no way to
      know what had changed.
    </p>

    <p>
      RP2040 microcontroller, GP2Y1014AU optical dust sensor, PM2.5 detection
      down to dust, mould, and pollen, and an LED that turns red past threshold.
      Boards soldered by hand in the school lab; enclosure drawn in CAD and 3D
      printed to keep the unit cost near nothing.
    </p>

    <p>
      Bootstrapped by selling merchandise at the Christmas fair. Five units sold
      at London trade fairs, Spitalfields among them. The VP of a components
      distributor followed our work; a venture firm tried to enter us into its
      startup competition, then learned we were under 18.
    </p>

    <p>
      Built alongside full-time school, which is where I learned electronics,
      CAD, and how to hold a team together.
    </p>
  </div>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <p>29.07.2026</p>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>
